WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:01:35.400
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:43.000
=Ren Yu=
(Adapted from Lei Mi's novel Ren Yu)

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.960
=Episode 17=

00:01:58.920 --> 00:01:59.560
Captain Wang!

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:00.920
We found a body.

00:02:01.439 --> 00:02:02.680
Medical examiner!

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:21.199
Put it... put it down here.

00:02:32.039 --> 00:02:33.159
Scene's almost done.

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:34.800
Store the evidence here for now.

00:02:35.319 --> 00:02:36.520
Go check the lab results.

00:02:36.759 --> 00:02:37.039
Okay.

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:37.719
Let me.

00:02:38.159 --> 00:02:38.479
Jiang.

00:02:38.879 --> 00:02:39.199
Jiang.

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:41.879
Water?

00:02:42.599 --> 00:02:43.120
Thanks.

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:51.000
Put everything here.

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:22.240
That's...

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:23.680
It's not Su Lin.

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:25.560
No.

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:27.520
It's okay.

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:30.879
Anyone would be scared

00:03:31.919 --> 00:03:32.680
the first time.

00:03:35.199 --> 00:03:36.080
If you feel sick,

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:37.400
go sit in the car for a bit.

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:46.280
I'll go ask around over there.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:47.919
Sit here for a bit.

00:03:48.519 --> 00:03:48.919
Mm-hmm.

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:51.560
You'll be okay.

00:03:56.719 --> 00:03:57.840
I'll head over.

00:03:59.159 --> 00:03:59.680
Chen.

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:02.080
Can I ask you something?

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:03.000
Sure.

00:04:03.759 --> 00:04:04.919
These tunnels are huge.

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:06.639
Could someone

00:04:07.319 --> 00:04:08.520
actually live down here?

00:04:08.919 --> 00:04:09.520
Live here?

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:11.919
Well.

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:13.159
I doubt it.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.560
There's always water down there.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:17.199
You can't sit or lie down.

00:04:17.839 --> 00:04:19.480
And the air quality is awful.

00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:21.959
The sewage is full of germs.

00:04:22.279 --> 00:04:23.079
Easy to get sick.

00:04:23.639 --> 00:04:25.199
But where we just went

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:27.079
was clearly on higher ground.

00:04:27.319 --> 00:04:28.160
And it was dry.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:29.439
That place...

00:04:29.519 --> 00:04:30.240
Oh, I know.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:33.240
It's a stormwater retention basin.

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:35.720
When there isn't much rain,

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.160
it stays pretty dry in there.

00:04:38.519 --> 00:04:40.399
You could probably live there.

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:42.600
But that's just our guess.

00:04:43.279 --> 00:04:45.079
If someone's really living,

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:47.480
that's hard to imagine.

00:04:50.399 --> 00:04:51.040
This map...

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:52.639
It's classified, right?

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:54.519
No. Public for years.

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:55.720
It's public?

00:04:55.759 --> 00:04:56.240
Yeah.

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:58.879
Can I keep this map?

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:00.240
Sure.

00:05:00.519 --> 00:05:01.079
It's yours.

00:05:01.279 --> 00:05:01.759
Thanks.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:02.560
No problem.

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:03.839
We have another copy.

00:05:04.279 --> 00:05:04.680
Okay.

00:05:04.759 --> 00:05:05.519
Back to work.

00:05:13.759 --> 00:05:15.519
Let Forensics handle the scene.

00:05:16.439 --> 00:05:18.000
Drain the basin ASAP.

00:05:18.519 --> 00:05:19.600
See if we missed anything.

00:05:20.279 --> 00:05:21.839
Take some people back with you.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:22.680
Run every check.

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:23.399
Test everything.

00:05:24.439 --> 00:05:25.720
Get the autopsy report ASAP.

00:05:28.839 --> 00:05:29.959
Mom, why are you here?

00:05:30.839 --> 00:05:32.360
Gu insisted on going underground.

00:05:32.399 --> 00:05:33.800
He's been gone forever.

00:05:33.839 --> 00:05:35.000
Of course I'm worried.

00:05:36.399 --> 00:05:37.360
Here. Eat something.

00:05:38.959 --> 00:05:39.399
Thanks.

00:05:39.399 --> 00:05:40.240
Checking on him.

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:41.800
You want me to go find him,

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:43.920
or file a missing person report?

00:05:44.639 --> 00:05:46.040
I've been a cop my whole life.

00:05:46.439 --> 00:05:47.120
Come on.

00:05:47.279 --> 00:05:49.240
You're 60. Stop trying to be a hero.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:51.439
I'm right here, aren't I?

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:52.959
I gotta go.

00:05:53.279 --> 00:05:53.720
Go on.

00:05:56.399 --> 00:05:57.879
Down there twice in one day.

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:00.079
You think you're 20 again?

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:02.360
Tai Wei tells you everything, huh?

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:03.240
So what?

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:06.639
Little snitch.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:09.000
Keep that attitude up,

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:10.720
and you're not getting this.

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:11.839
What is it?

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:13.720
I called in a favor.

00:06:13.959 --> 00:06:14.879
Sanitation Bureau.

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:17.240
The underground utility map you wanted.

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:18.240
They've got it all.

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:21.519
Gimme.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:23.279
Come on.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.000
So you came to help me after all.

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:28.360
Such a smooth talker.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.040
Who'd you get it from?

00:06:31.079 --> 00:06:31.680
Mr. Wu.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:36.839
Mr. Wu?

00:06:37.879 --> 00:06:38.839
Then I guess

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:42.079
I'll have to thank him sometime.

00:06:42.279 --> 00:06:43.920
He's not just a great dancer.

00:06:44.439 --> 00:06:45.120
He's nice too.

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:47.319
Then learn it.

00:06:47.879 --> 00:06:49.680
It's dancing, not calculus.

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:50.560
You can learn it.

00:06:50.879 --> 00:06:51.800
Eat while you look.

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:00.300
(Chaobei Underground Utility Map)

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:14.560
(Chaobei Underground Utility Map)

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:17.959
This map...

00:07:19.639 --> 00:07:20.600
The maps differ.

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:24.920
(Chaobei Underground Utility Map)

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:25.800
This part

00:07:26.319 --> 00:07:27.439
of these two maps is different.

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:30.600
(Chaobei Underground Utility Map)
They are

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:31.759
different.

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:32.720
Gu.

00:07:33.199 --> 00:07:33.839
Nice catch.

00:07:34.879 --> 00:07:35.439
Look.

00:07:35.879 --> 00:07:36.560
This area

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:37.560
(Chaobei Underground Utility Map)

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:39.759
isn't exist

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:41.399
(Chaobei Underground Utility Map)
on the older map.

00:07:42.680 --> 00:07:43.279
This sanitation map

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.040
was probably added later.

00:07:45.639 --> 00:07:46.759
If I remember right,

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:47.759
that should be

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:49.600
the old waterworks tower.

00:07:49.959 --> 00:07:51.759
It connects to a space above ground.

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:53.439
Sealed years ago.

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:54.519
It's abandoned.

00:07:55.199 --> 00:07:56.160
Maybe because

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:57.519
it's not sanitation,

00:07:57.680 --> 00:07:58.920
it was never put on record.

00:08:00.839 --> 00:08:01.560
Engineer Chen.

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:04.240
Could someone live there?

00:08:05.759 --> 00:08:06.480
Possibly.

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:07.600
(Chaobei Underground Utility Map)

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:09.040
If I wanted to get there,

00:08:09.279 --> 00:08:11.360
where's the closest way down?

00:08:14.519 --> 00:08:15.480
Cultural Square lawn.

00:08:17.399 --> 00:08:18.040
Gu.

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.480
You can't go down again.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:22.279
Captain Wang's team is searching now.

00:08:22.839 --> 00:08:23.879
If they find anything,

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:25.439
they'll tell Tai Wei.

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:26.839
I know.

00:08:27.279 --> 00:08:28.439
I won't go down. Promise.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:48.919
This is it, right?

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:52.360
This is it?

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:55.720
Why are you here?

00:08:56.279 --> 00:08:57.039
Looking for Su Lin.

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:00.879
Coming down too?

00:09:01.639 --> 00:09:02.159
No way.

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:04.159
You've already been down today.

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:05.759
You know what it's like down there.

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:06.480
And...

00:09:06.799 --> 00:09:07.600
- What if-
- I know.

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:08.519
I know all of it.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.159
I have to find Su Lin.

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:11.519
Why are you so stubborn?

00:09:11.879 --> 00:09:12.720
Hear me out.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:14.480
Ever since Ting was little,

00:09:14.519 --> 00:09:15.960
finish what you start.

00:09:16.519 --> 00:09:18.000
I can't be a hypocrite.

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:19.159
Besides,

00:09:19.759 --> 00:09:20.559
without Su Lin,

00:09:20.759 --> 00:09:22.000
Ting can't rest.

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:23.559
Neither will I.

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:25.240
I have to find her

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:26.320
and give Ting some answers.

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:27.720
I brought everything I need.

00:09:28.039 --> 00:09:29.080
Flashlight.

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:30.039
Fresh batteries.

00:09:30.279 --> 00:09:30.799
They're good.

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:31.519
Line,

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:32.639
to mark our way.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:33.519
All set.

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:34.639
Every tool we need

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:36.279
is right here.

00:09:36.759 --> 00:09:37.600
I'm ready.

00:09:41.159 --> 00:09:42.360
You two are just alike.

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:54.720
Don't worry.

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:56.279
I studied

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:57.399
that map real close.

00:09:58.159 --> 00:10:00.360
Go straight down the branch line.

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:02.559
When we hit the main line,

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:03.720
we turn.

00:10:04.519 --> 00:10:05.440
Then we're there.

00:10:15.159 --> 00:10:15.600
This way.

00:10:39.519 --> 00:10:40.200
Mr. Gu.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:43.919
There's a door.

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:03.519
Hold the fishing line for me.

00:11:29.279 --> 00:11:30.279
I'll go in first.

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:32.679
If...

00:11:33.759 --> 00:11:34.600
if anything happens,

00:11:35.639 --> 00:11:36.279
run.

00:11:41.399 --> 00:11:42.200
Mr. Gu.

00:11:47.679 --> 00:11:48.399
Be careful.

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:29.159
Jiang.

00:12:30.679 --> 00:12:31.399
Come on in.

00:12:48.039 --> 00:12:48.840
Just look at this.

00:12:50.919 --> 00:12:52.360
Someone's clearly living here.

00:12:53.639 --> 00:12:54.320
And

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:57.080
they've been here a while.

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:08.440
Mr. Gu.

00:13:09.639 --> 00:13:10.240
Mr. Gu.

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:12.759
A uniform.

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:14.120
It's exactly like Ting's.

00:13:15.399 --> 00:13:16.080
Like Ting's.

00:13:16.919 --> 00:13:17.759
Jiang, turn around.

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:21.440
(The Little Mermaid)

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:38.320
(Chinese)

00:13:38.320 --> 00:13:43.240
(New English Course)

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:48.559
Jiang.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:54.360
We found her.

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:00.920
(Hospitality Su Lin)

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:02.519
We found the girl.

00:14:11.639 --> 00:14:12.240
We found her.

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:21.159
Why would she live here?

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:23.240
We found her. Good.

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:25.600
Worth the effort.

00:14:26.759 --> 00:14:27.759
If she's living here,

00:14:28.679 --> 00:14:30.120
she'll come back after dark.

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:31.799
We wait.

00:14:33.639 --> 00:14:34.480
We'll wait for her.

00:14:36.799 --> 00:14:37.559
We wait.

00:14:52.639 --> 00:14:53.159
Jiang.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:54.840
Come here.

00:14:56.759 --> 00:14:57.279
Come here.

00:14:57.600 --> 00:14:59.679
I don't think Su Lin lives here alone.

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:00.759
Look.

00:15:08.159 --> 00:15:08.960
Who could it be?

00:15:09.559 --> 00:15:10.480
Let's not guess.

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:12.440
Once we see Su Lin,

00:15:13.399 --> 00:15:14.240
we'll know.

00:15:15.279 --> 00:15:16.000
Vincent.

00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:17.759
Vincent.

00:15:18.559 --> 00:15:19.360
Where are we going

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:20.080
this late?

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.240
Vincent.

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:38.840
How the heck did you find this place?

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:40.679
Didn't I tell you I'd come find you?

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:41.679
Need money?

00:15:42.159 --> 00:15:42.720
Buy...

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:44.559
Buy... buy IDs.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:46.679
- Buy IDs.
- ID cards.

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:48.159
3,000 yuan. Two cards.

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:01.879
When did you learn to smile?

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:16.000
Enough?

00:16:17.639 --> 00:16:18.919
Everyone else got busted.

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:20.879
I'm the only one who can do it now.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:23.440
No.

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:23.759
Buy.

00:16:23.799 --> 00:16:24.679
- Let's go.
- Buy them.

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:25.320
Buy IDs.

00:16:25.440 --> 00:16:26.440
- No. Let's go.
- Buy.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:27.759
No fake IDs.

00:16:27.919 --> 00:16:29.240
Think fake IDs are easy to make?

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:30.879
I'm taking a huge risk here.

00:16:48.039 --> 00:16:48.720
Mr. Gu.

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:51.600
Once we find her,

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:52.799
what are you going to do?

00:17:14.039 --> 00:17:14.759
It's late.

00:17:15.559 --> 00:17:17.000
Jiang, maybe you should go home.

00:17:17.519 --> 00:17:18.519
I'll wait for her here.

00:17:18.920 --> 00:17:19.599
If she does,

00:17:20.079 --> 00:17:21.839
I'll call you as soon as I see her.

00:17:22.359 --> 00:17:23.519
Otherwise, Ting's at home

00:17:23.759 --> 00:17:25.200
worrying this late at night.

00:17:25.799 --> 00:17:26.359
It's okay.

00:17:27.279 --> 00:17:28.039
I'll wait.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:29.000
Who knows?

00:17:29.319 --> 00:17:30.880
Su Lin might be back soon.

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:32.119
Besides,

00:17:33.519 --> 00:17:34.440
Ting wants me

00:17:35.039 --> 00:17:36.039
to find her too.

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:41.519
You're a good mom.

00:17:43.079 --> 00:17:44.200
Ting's lucky to have you.

00:17:48.240 --> 00:17:49.039
Su Lin's so young.

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:52.559
She's just a girl.

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:55.519
How can she live in a place like this?

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:01.359
If it were Ting,

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:05.240
I can't even imagine it.

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:09.720
Like I said,

00:18:11.039 --> 00:18:11.799
once we find her,

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:15.440
what happens

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:18.759
after that?

00:18:19.519 --> 00:18:20.480
We found her.

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:22.839
We'll find a way.

00:18:31.039 --> 00:18:32.200
Jiang, what's wrong?

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:34.640
You feeling sick?

00:18:42.759 --> 00:18:43.839
I've got hot water.

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:45.160
Have some.

00:18:46.559 --> 00:18:47.279
Mr. Gu.

00:18:49.359 --> 00:18:51.640
My blood sugar might be low.

00:18:52.799 --> 00:18:54.039
Could you check for me?

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:56.160
I rushed out this morning.

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:57.759
I can't remember if I packed candy.

00:18:58.039 --> 00:18:59.359
Why didn't you say so?

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:02.680
Where's the candy?

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:04.720
Wait.

00:19:05.079 --> 00:19:06.359
Low blood sugar

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:07.559
can be dangerous.

00:19:07.599 --> 00:19:08.680
Where'd you put it?

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:00.200
Take it slow.

00:20:00.279 --> 00:20:00.839
I'm okay.

00:20:01.039 --> 00:20:01.319
Easy.

00:20:01.359 --> 00:20:01.720
I'm fine.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:02.119
Careful.

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:02.559
Easy.

00:20:02.559 --> 00:20:03.319
I'm okay. Really.

00:20:04.279 --> 00:20:04.920
I'll help you.

00:20:05.039 --> 00:20:05.880
No need.

00:20:06.559 --> 00:20:07.720
I have meds at home.

00:20:07.839 --> 00:20:08.400
I'm fine.

00:20:09.319 --> 00:20:09.920
You good?

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:10.519
I'll be fine.

00:20:11.279 --> 00:20:11.880
I'm off, then.

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:12.359
Okay.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:13.480
Oh, right.

00:20:13.880 --> 00:20:15.640
Let me know if you hear about Su Lin.

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:16.160
Of course.

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:16.920
Of course.

00:20:17.599 --> 00:20:18.400
Be careful.

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:18.960
